integration/results/

# A personal skill that materialized into this repo's skill directory. The skills that ARE committed
# here (`align/`, `bug-hunt/`) are the ones this project ships and expects a contributor to have;
# this one is the author's own toolkit and is deliberately not shared state. Targeted rather than a
# blanket `.claude/skills/` ignore, which would misdescribe the tracked ones.
.claude/skills/cli-best-practices/
